+  → TrainingActiveScreen 全量 SetEditorCard                [TrainingActiveScreen:232-255]
+  → TrainingViewModel.save()                              [TrainingViewModel:439-545]
+      ├─ cardioExercises = recordType.isNotBlank()         ← P0 错误分流（:443-444）
+      ├─ cardioDetails.durationSeconds = cfg.durationSec   ← P0 目标伪装实际（:512-524）
+      └─ repo.saveUnifiedSession()                         [TrainingRepository:183-244]
+           ├─ workout_session insert
+           ├─ workout_exercise delete + insert
+           ├─ workout_cardio_detail delete + insert
+           ├─ WorkoutCalorieCalculator.combine()           [WorkoutCalorieCalculator:70-100]
+           ├─ 账本 upsert（sourceType=STRENGTH_TRAINING, sourceId=uuid）
+           └─ upsertTrainingDiaryLog(type 固定"力量")       [TrainingRepository:266-278]
+
+编辑：vm.editSession() → repo.sessionDetail()（只返回力量）[TrainingRepository:305-306]
+历史：TrainingDiaryContent → vm.allWorkoutExercises（只含 workout_exercise）
+复制计划：repo.saveSessionAsTemplate() → 只读 workoutExerciseDao.findBySession() [TrainingRepository:414-455]
+备份：TrainingBackup（6 表，无 workout_cardio_detail、无新字段）[TrainingBackup:27-89]
+```
